{"availability":"available","full":"Abhishek2005-Siva/support-orchestrator","name":"support-orchestrator","description":"Multi-agent customer-support orchestration: LangGraph + FastAPI + NVIDIA NIM, with guardrails, human-in-the-loop review, evals and a web UI","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-04T06:07:04Z","updated":"2026-10-05T05:18:37Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://orbit-support-ui.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://orbit-support.onrender.com/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T05:50:20.928Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T05:50:20.928Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T05:50:20.928Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T06:11:51.662Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-05T05:50:20.928Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live console (Vercel) · API (Render) · all data is synthetic Free tier: the first request after idle takes 30-60 s to wake. Answers take 8 s because the free NVIDIA endpoint is slow.","New here? Open the live console. A one-screen intro explains the project in plain English, and one click plays a real duplicate-charge case with a bar that narrates each step."],"features":["Policy as code, language as LLM. Refund eligibility (30-day monthly, 14-day annual, 90-day duplicate, $100 auto-approval limit) is a deterministic, unit-tested engine. The model phrases the answer; it never decides…","Intent-gated writes. createrefundrequest and createticket run only if the customer's own message asks for it and the dispatcher agrees. A prompt injection cannot make the agent issue a refund.","Two-layer validator, fail-closed. Deterministic grounding (every figure must appear in tool output) plus an independent LLM judge. Unsure or unreachable means a human sees it, never the customer.","Humans are inside the graph. interrupt() plus a checkpointer: staff approval resumes the same run and updates the customer's chat.","Identity the model cannot choose. customerid comes from the JWT and is injected into every tool call. Tools are allow-listed per agent."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abhishek2005-Siva/support-orchestrator/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a23eb8d42cd44133f05591f60248597145413ae8ad5e4696ed2c5647fdd73245","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T05:51:32.874Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T05:51:32.874Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Live console (Vercel) · API (Render) · all data is synthetic Free tier: the first request after idle takes 30-60 s to wake. Answers take 8 s because the free NVIDIA endpoint is slow.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abhishek2005-Siva/support-orchestrator/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Or pick a login and write anything.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abhishek2005-Siva/support-orchestrator/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The agent works out the problem from your message, not from the login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abhishek2005-Siva/support-orchestrator/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"a23eb8d42cd44133f05591f60248597145413ae8ad5e4696ed2c5647fdd73245","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abhishek2005-Siva/support-orchestrator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T05:51:32.874Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T05:18:37Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abhishek2005-Siva/support-orchestrator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T05:51:32.875Z","hash":"a23eb8d42cd44133f05591f60248597145413ae8ad5e4696ed2c5647fdd73245","originalBytes":8609,"storedBytes":8609,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["reports","docs","eval","refund","customer","agent","every","validator","case","console","escalation","golden","live","run","tool","billing","duplicate","free","real","runs","support","what","after","guardrails.md","human","license","load","message